`req.params.id` is interpolated straight into the query string. A request to `/user/1;DROP TABLE users--` or `/user/1 OR 1=1` is executed verbatim. This is the whole vulnerability class — everything else below is secondary.

Use a parameterized query so the driver sends the value out-of-band:

```js
